---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="What this site collects when you register interest in Palm Central, how it's used, who it's shared with, and how analytics works across the DST network."
>
  <section class="container hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      This page covers what palmcentral.dst.llc actually collects and does
      with it — not a generic template. Last updated 5 August 2026.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>Who this is</h2>
    <p>
      palmcentral.dst.llc is operated by DST, an independent advisory site
      covering Palm Central by Nakheel — not affiliated with or endorsed by
      Nakheel. For the property transaction itself, DST's digital partner is
      DEAL KEY PROPERTIES LLC (DED License No. 1523000, RERA ORN 52875), a
      licensed Dubai brokerage. This site handles content and lead capture;
      the brokerage handles the regulated side of any actual purchase.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>
      If you use the "Register interest" form, we collect what you type into
      it: your name, email, phone or WhatsApp number, and — if you choose to
      answer them — the unit type you're interested in and your approximate
      budget range. Every field except name and one contact method is
      optional; nothing on this site requires an account or login.
    </p>
    <p>
      Separately, this site uses Google Analytics 4 to see aggregate traffic
      — pages visited, approximate location from IP address (city-level, not
      precise), device and browser type. Analytics data is not tied back to
      the contact details you submit through the form unless you submit both
      in the same session, in which case Google's standard cross-referencing
      applies the same way it would on any site running GA4.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>What we do with it</h2>
    <p>
      Form submissions go to DST's team and, for this site specifically, to
      DEAL KEY PROPERTIES LLC so they can follow up about current Palm
      Central availability matching what you asked for. We don't sell
      contact details to third parties, and we don't use them for anything
      beyond responding to the inquiry you actually submitted.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>Cookies and cross-site analytics</h2>
    <p>
      DST runs several sites under the dst.llc domain (this one, riviera,
      llc, visas, and others), sharing one Google Analytics 4 property so
      traffic can be measured across the network rather than site by site.
      The analytics cookie is scoped to the whole <code>.dst.llc</code> domain
      for that reason — if you've visited another DST site, the same
      analytics cookie applies here. We don't currently run advertising or
      retargeting cookies on this site.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>
      Form submissions are kept for as long as reasonably useful for
      following up on your inquiry and for our own records of who we've been
      in contact with — typically no more than a few years unless you become
      an active client of the brokerage, in which case their own retention
      practices apply. Analytics data follows Google Analytics' standard
      retention settings.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>Your options</h2>
    <p>
      To ask what we hold about you, correct it, or have it deleted, use the
      <a href="/#interest" title="Register interest in Palm Central">form on this site</a> and
      say what you need — we'll handle it directly rather than routing you
      through a separate request process. Most browsers also let you block
      or clear analytics cookies without affecting anything else on the
      site.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>Other DST sites</h2>
    <p>
      This page links out to <a href="https://visas.dst.llc/golden/" title="Golden Visa via property investment — visas.dst.llc">visas.dst.llc</a> for
      Golden Visa content. That's a separate site in the same network,
      sharing this same privacy approach, but its own pages are what
      actually governs data you submit there.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If what this site collects or does with it changes, this page changes
      with it — there's no separate changelog, just the "last updated" date
      at the top.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
